@echo off\nsetlocal EnableExtensions\npushd "%~dp0" >nul 2>&1\ntitle Nunes Recruitment V11.11.24 Diagnostics\n\necho ============================================================\necho  NUNES V11.11.24 - ALL CANDIDATES + RAG KEYWORD\necho ============================================================\necho.\necho [1] Version\npowershell -NoProfile -NonInteractive -Command "try{Invoke-RestMethod -TimeoutSec 4 http://127.0.0.1:5286/version|ConvertTo-Json -Depth 8}catch{Write-Host $_.Exception.Message -ForegroundColor Red}"\necho.\necho [2] Recruitment overview / All + New counts\npowershell -NoProfile -NonInteractive -Command "try{Invoke-RestMethod -TimeoutSec 7 'http://127.0.0.1:5286/api/recruitment/overview?roles=10&recent=12'|ConvertTo-Json -Depth 14}catch{Write-Host $_.Exception.Message -ForegroundColor Red}"\necho.\necho [3] Ranking status\npowershell -NoProfile -NonInteractive -Command "try{Invoke-RestMethod -TimeoutSec 6 http://127.0.0.1:5286/api/role-ranking-status|ConvertTo-Json -Depth 12}catch{Write-Host $_.Exception.Message -ForegroundColor Red}"\necho.\necho [4] Candidate access\npowershell -NoProfile -NonInteractive -Command "try{Invoke-RestMethod -TimeoutSec 6 http://127.0.0.1:5286/api/indeed/permission-status|ConvertTo-Json -Depth 12}catch{Write-Host $_.Exception.Message -ForegroundColor Red}"\necho.\necho EXPECTED:\necho   - All and New counts from current Indeed Jobs.\necho   - New applicants prioritized.\necho   - Older active applicants backfilled automatically.\necho   - Ranked count rises when resume + JD evidence is readable.\necho.\npause\n